## 2. IP Addressing & VLAN Table
The HQ Campus uses the private 10.10.0.0/16 address range, which is broken down into /24 subnets for each VLAN.


| VLAN ID | VLAN Name | Subnet Network | Subnet Mask | Gateway IP (`HQ-SW1`) | Purpose |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **VLAN 10** | `DATA_USERS` | `10.10.10.0/24` | `255.255.255.0` | `10.10.10.1` | User PCs (`PC1`: `10.10.10.10`) |
| **VLAN 20** | `VOICE_IP` | `10.10.20.0/24` | `255.255.255.0` | `10.10.20.1` | IP Phones |
| **VLAN 99** | `NATIVE_MGMT` | `10.10.99.0/24` | `255.255.255.0` | `10.10.99.1` | Switch Management (`HQ-SW2`: `10.10.99.2`) |
| **P2P Link**| `WAN_TRANSIT`| `10.0.0.0/30` | `255.255.255.252`| N/A | Router Link (`HQ-SW1` to `HQ-R1`) |

